«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  LgNrmSx
  @  Standard deviation of the law.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 == THEN Explode Drop ELSE IF DUP Size 3 == THEN Explode Drop Drop ELSE "LgNrmSx: needs 2 arguments" DoError END END END
  → μlv σlv « μlv 0 + σlv 0 + → μl σl « '√((EXP(σl^2)-1)*EXP(2*μl+σl^2))' →Num μlv σlv 2 →List Drop » »
»
